<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>لا توجد تقييمات</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f2027, #203a43, #2c5364);
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      direction: rtl;
    }

    .glass-box {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 40px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(31, 38, 135, 0.37);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      color: #ffffff;
      max-width: 400px;
    }

    .glass-box h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .glass-box p {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .btn-home {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #00c9ff;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #92fe9d, #00c9ff);
      color: #000;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .btn-home:hover {
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="glass-box">
    <h1>لا توجد تقييمات حتى الآن</h1>
    <p>لم يقم أي مستخدم بتقييم هذا الوسيط بعد.</p>

    <button class="btn-home" onclick="goBack()">رجوع</button>

    <script>
      function goBack() {
        window.history.back();
      }
    </script>
  </div>
</body>
</html>